fixture charged_strike_goes_the_way_it_was_let_go
doc docs/adr/0013, the Charged strike: "in the direction the stick held on the release" (task 6 review, M4). The hold is let go on frame 31 with the stick right, during a dash; the request waits for dash frame 6 while the stick turns left, and the strike still goes right.
room test/flat
frames 50
input
  0..28 attack
  29 R attack dash
  30 R attack
  31 R
  32..40 L
end
expect
  at 31 event.charge_release=1
  mark go 0..49 action=charged
  at go action_dir=1
end
